      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Alma Trunk bag from Louis Vuitton's 2026 Resort collection cleverly merges the arch-shaped silhouette of the Alma with the corner reinforcements of a classic trunk. The golden Millefleurs motif, inspired by medieval tapestry patterns and the house's iconic Monogram floral elements, imbues the bag with a romantic, courtly allure.",
