    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton's 2026 Resort women's collection takes \"theater\" as its theme, with the show staged at the Palais des Papes in Avignon, France. Artistic director Nicolas Ghesquière drew inspiration from medieval religious manuscripts, court frescoes, and knightly armor, infusing the designs with sculptural lines, metallic luster, and tapestry-like prints. The result is a handbag lineup brimming with dramatic narrative tension.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
