          "price": "阿尔马桥"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "With its rounded arch-shaped top, dual-zip closure, curved base, and smooth Toron handles, the bag achieves a perfect balance between architectural precision and timeless elegance—a marriage of exacting craftsmanship and effortless grace.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
