          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/w4rdu64/9de667925081f177.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/w4rdu64/677f44619115f303.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"Millefleurs\" is a background pattern style popular in the late Middle Ages and Renaissance, typically featuring flowers and plants as its main decorative elements. Commonly found in European tapestries and wall hangings, the term \"Mille fleurs\" literally translates to \"a thousand flowers\" in French.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/w4rdu64/8bae2c7548951ab1.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/w4rdu64/0ddf46dcd7e81886.jpg",
          "price": "16世纪欧洲挂毯图案"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/w4rdu64/be2976a06b295450.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/w4rdu64/1c75c957d7bc0bfa.jpg",
          "price": "14世纪泥金装饰手抄本"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The golden ornamentation on this bag is created using hot-stamping techniques, resulting in a subtle embossed texture. The shimmering gilded effect calls to mind the precious illuminated manuscripts of the medieval papal court, infusing the bag with a classical romantic sensibility.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in for an ultra-clear visual experience.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· How to Wear This Bag ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/w4rdu64/1ea8a31b14f276b3.jpg",
