      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The golden chain adds a touch of movement and sparkle, harmonizing with the bag's golden motif. It can also be used as a shoulder strap. Additionally, a detachable, adjustable leather strap is included for versatile shoulder or crossbody styling.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The calfskin-wrapped Toron handles are rounded and resilient, remaining comfortable even during extended carrying. The hardware is finely engraved with the Louis Vuitton logo, each piece crafted with meticulous attention to detail.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
