    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We managed to fit an A6 notebook, an iPhone, a compact mirror, a perfume bottle, a cushion compact, tissues, a card holder, and keys inside. The dual-zip closure ensures easy access, and the interior capacity is sufficient for daily essentials.",
