    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton is a globally renowned luggage and leather goods brand founded in Paris in 1854 by Louis Vuitton. In 1987, it merged with Moët Hennessy to form LVMH, the world's largest luxury group. In addition to travel trunks and handbags, the brand also ventures into fashion, jewelry, eyewear, shoes, watches, and fragrances. Since 1854 from Paris.",
